name: ['Elesh Norn, Grand Cenobite', 'Force of Will', 'Greater Good', "Hanna, Ship's Navigator", 'Karador, Ghost Chieftain', 'Nekusar, the Mindrazer', 'Oloro, Ageless Ascetic', 'Riku of Two Reflections', 'Sword of Feast and Famine']
